doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21310278
url: "https://github.com/HydroUper-lab/gsmap-explorer"

abstract: >
  GSMaP Explorer is a Python-based software developed for processing,
  visualization, and hydrological analysis of GSMaP NetCDF rainfall data
  over Indonesia. The software supports rainfall extraction, watershed
  and sub-watershed analysis, Thiessen polygon generation, areal rainfall
  computation, and export of processed results for further hydrological
  applications.

keywords:
